 "title": "Praise to the Lord, the Almighty",
 "description": "Joachim Neander's hymn of praise in Catherine Winkworth's English, to the chorale Lobe den Herren in the four parts of The Chorale Book for England (1863), for 2 to 4 singers: the first two verses, broad and joyful.",
 "language": "en",
 "difficulty": "beginner",
